        <item>
            <title>2.49.1</title>
            <pubDate>Mon, 28 Sep 2026 15:31:18 +0900</pubDate>
            <link>https://github.com/Saqoosha/Canopy</link>
            <sparkle:version>144</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>2.49.1</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>15.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[### Changes
- Other Macs' closed sessions and recent folders moved from the sidebar to the launcher. Pick a Mac under "Other Macs" in the location chip to start a session in one of its folders, or use Resume… to reopen one of its closed sessions. The sidebar now shows only other Macs' live sessions, so this Mac's own Recents are no longer pushed off screen.
- The Resume… menu groups sessions by project, puts the selected folder's project first, and shows each session's branch and age.
]]></description>
