        <item>
            <title>2.48.0</title>
            <pubDate>Mon, 28 Sep 2026 08:43:46 +0900</pubDate>
            <link>https://github.com/Saqoosha/Canopy</link>
            <sparkle:version>142</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>2.48.0</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>15.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[### Features
- Each remote Mac's sidebar section now offers **New Session in…** (its recent folders) and its closed **Recents**. Picking one starts or resumes the session on that Mac and opens it here as a mirror pane, without opening anything on that Mac's screen. The other Mac must be on this version too.
]]></description>
